{"id":"8f6e855c76a877bf","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-LR-LK.md","title":"LR归约蕴含相对前缀复杂度归约","display":"thm-LR-LK — LR归约蕴含相对前缀复杂度归约","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-LR-LK","aliases":["43-thm-LR-LK"],"display":"thm-LR-LK — LR归约蕴含相对前缀复杂度归约","depends_on":["[[43-df-lr-red]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Theorem 15.1.41; printed pp.429–430 / PDF pp.449–450","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-LR-LK"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-LR-LK</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-LR-LK — LR归约蕴含相对前缀复杂度归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c03c10d191232ac0\" href=\"?note=c03c10d191232ac0\" title=\"43-df-lr-red\">43-df-lr-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 15.1.41; printed pp.429–430 / PDF pp.449–450"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c03c10d191232ac0\" href=\"?note=c03c10d191232ac0\" title=\"43-df-lr-red\">43-df-lr-red</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K^A,K^B\">\\(K^A,K^B\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a> 的同一通用oracle机器。本节引入二元关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{LK}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{LK}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_{\\mathrm{LK}}B\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;K^B(\\sigma)\\le K^A(\\sigma)+c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_{\\mathrm{LK}}B\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;K^B(\\sigma)\\le K^A(\\sigma)+c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}B\\Rightarrow A\\le_{\\mathrm{LK}}B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}B\\Rightarrow A\\le_{\\mathrm{LK}}B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>LK的复杂度不等式方向与oracle参数次序相反；它不是13.7的rK初段有限候选归约。原稿证明中J/I的包含方向和若干补集符号有笔误，本轮只将无歧义的定理陈述录入，未标记来源证明已核验。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 15.1.41; printed pp.429–430 / PDF pp.449–450。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-lr-red","status":"resolved","id":"c03c10d191232ac0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lr-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lr-red","status":"resolved","id":"c03c10d191232ac0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}$ 见 [[43-df-lr-red]]，$K^A,K^B$ 使用 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的同一通用oracle机器。本节引入二元关系 $\\le_{\\mathrm{LK}}$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}$ 见 [[43-df-lr-red]]，$K^A,K^B$ 使用 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的同一通用oracle机器。本节引入二元关系 $\\le_{\\mathrm{LK}}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}","display":false},{"tex":"K^A,K^B","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\mathrm{LK}}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_{\\mathrm{LK}}B\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;K^B(\\sigma)\\le K^A(\\sigma)+c.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}B\\Rightarrow A\\le_{\\mathrm{LK}}B.","display":true}],"bytes":1556,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-405","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-LR-LK]] — LR归约蕴含相对前缀复杂度归约"}],"outgoing":["c03c10d191232ac0","6cd902d852c2c848"]}